Saudi foreign minister arrives in Washington, DC ahead of meeting with US Secretary 






                Saudi Foreign Minister Faisal bin Farhan Al Saud has arrived in Washington, DC, for an official visit, according to the kingdom's state news agency.&nbsp;

He is set to meet with&nbsp;US Secretary of State Marco Rubio to discuss key regional and international developments.

